tiny386 - frank-386
C99 i386 PC emulator  |  core ~6K LOC  |  BSD-3-Clause
orig: He Chunhui (hchunhui/tiny386)
RP2350 port: FRANK-386 (rh1tech) + Waveshare Pi Zero fork

HOST
  chip     RP2350  (Pico 2 / FRANK / Waveshare RP2350-PiZero)
  cores    dual Cortex-M33  or  Hazard3 RISC-V
  clocks   cpu_freq = 378 | 504 MHz
           psram_freq = 133 | 166 MHz
  extra    8MB PSRAM required for extended RAM
           PIO used for HDMI / PS/2 / gamepad
  boards   FRANK  M1  M2  Olimex PICO-PC  Waveshare Z2

GUEST CPU
  type     i386 interpreter  (+ partial i486 / i586)
  opt      x87 FPU, i686, MMX, SSE..SSSE3, amd64 long mode
  gen      3=386  4=486  5=586  6=686
  fpu      0 | 1
  missing  debug, hardware tasking, some privilege checks
  files    i386.c / i386.h / i386ins.def
           fpu.c / fpu.h
           amd64.c / amd64.h   (optional)

GUEST REGS  (fundamentals)
  GPR32    EAX ECX EDX EBX  ESP EBP ESI EDI
  GPR16    AX  CX  DX  BX   SP  BP  SI  DI
  GPR8     AL AH CL CH DL DH BL BH
  IP       EIP / IP
  FLAGS    CF PF AF ZF SF TF IF DF OF
           IOPL NT RF VM AC VIF VIP ID
  segs     CS DS SS ES FS GS
           selector + base + limit + attrib
  ctrl     CR0 CR2 CR3 CR4
           PE MP EM TS ET NE WP AM NW CD NW PG
  sys      GDTR IDTR LDTR TR
  x87      ST(0)..ST(7)  CWD SW TW  IP/DP/OP

MEMORY
  guest    mem = 1M..8M   typical mem=8M
  holes    BIOS + VGA windows
  vga      ISA VGA + Bochs VBE   up to 640x480
           vga_mem_size configurable
  fw       bios.bin + vgabios.bin   (SeaBIOS)
  alt      linuxstart stub -> vmlinux  (no BIOS)

CHIPSET / IO
  i8259    PIC   IRQ 0..15
  i8254    PIT   IRQ0 timer / speaker
  i8042    kbd + mouse controller
  CMOS     RTC
  i8257    ISA DMA
  IDE      hda hdb hdc hdd / ATAPI CD
  floppy   fda fdb
  NE2000   ISA NIC
  sound    PC speaker  AdLib OPL2  SB16
           FRANK extras: Tandy  Covox  DSS  MPU-401

CONFIG VARS  (config.ini / tiny386.ini)
  mem=8M
  bios=bios.bin
  vga_bios=vgabios.bin
  gen=3|4|5|6
  fpu=0|1
  fill_cmos=1     MS-DOS/Win9x   (0 for NT)
  cpu_freq=504
  psram_freq=166
  redirector=1    mapdrive H:
  disks in /386/  .img floppy/hdd   .iso CD

I/O ON RP2350
  video    VGA or HDMI/DVI
  input    PS/2 kbd/mouse  |  USB HID host
           NES/SNES pad (mouse-emulation mode)
  store    SD SPI   FAT32   /386/
  hotkeys  Win+F11 settings   Win+F12 disk swap

BOOT TARGETS
  DOS   Win 3.1   Win 95   lean Linux
  not a modern full-fat distro
  ESP32 was usable/slow; RP2350 is the faster port
